  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the Danish Engagement in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the evaluation was to assess the contribution of Denmark to the establishment of a viable Palestinian State as part of a negotiated two-state solution. The evaluation also provided input for the next strategy period and programme phase of the Danish engagement in Palestine from 2016 onwards.</narrative>
  </description>
